MBPT>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Used by ALL MBPT programs 
Nso = 12 - CI core 
Nsh = 12 - defines SCF field (For MS calculations Nsh=Nso) 
Nss =999 
Nsv = 13 - =Nso+1 
Nmax=210 
Lmax=  4 - max (l_i,l_k) for valence radial integrals 
Kmax=  9 - max multipolarity of two-electron valence integrals 
Kt  =  1 - Keep this fixed 
Kbrt=  2 - Breit interaction 
Kout=  0 - Details in output file 
<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<< 
SMS:>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>> (p_i dot p_k) interaction 
C_sms= 0.00000   - scaling of SMS interaction 
Klow=  1         - lower component included/ignored 
<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<< 
RPA >>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Used by programs which deal with RPA MEs 
A_hf   0 | 
B_hf   0 | 
E1_L   0 | 
EDM    0 | - Right hand side operators 
PNC    0 | 
E1_V   0 | 
AM     0 | 
MQM    0 | 
M1     1 | 
E2     1 | 
E3     0 | 
M2     0 | 
M3     1 | 
========================= 
Nhf = 12 - SCF procedure includes Nhf upper shells (Nsh,Nsh-1,...) 
Kmg =  0 - if not zero, Omega gives frequency of external field 
Omega= 0.057580(a.u.) 
Kex =  1 - key for exchange (0 - skip, 1 - include) 
<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<< 
